+# Fork extension
+
+Add this extension to the agent directory's `settings.json`:
+
+```json
+{
+  "extensions": ["/absolute/path/to/packages/coding-agent/examples/extensions/fork/index.ts"]
+}
+```
+
+The `fork` tool takes `{ "task": "..." }` and returns a fork ID as soon as a separate pi process starts. The process inherits the current model, thinking level, environment, settings, extensions, and the conversation visible to the model when it called the tool. It saves its own session beside the parent session. Its final answer or failure arrives later as a visible `fork-result` message in the parent session.
+
+Forks stop when their parent session ends. `/reload` leaves them running. A fork cannot use the `fork` tool.
